'Constant speed, vacuum surface and rigid bottom'  ! TITLE
@FREQUENCY_HZ@          ! FREQ (Hz)
1                       ! NMEDIA
'CVW'                   ! C-linear SSP, vacuum surface, dB/wavelength
2  0.0  100.0           ! SSP points, sigma, bottom depth (m)
0.0    1500.0 /
100.0  1500.0 /
'R' 0.0                 ! Rigid flat bottom, zero roughness
1                       ! NSD
50.0 /                  ! Source depth (m)
51                      ! NRD
0.0  100.0 /            ! Receiver depths (m)
201                     ! NR
0.01  5.0 /             ! Receiver ranges (km)
'CC'                    ! Coherent TL, Cartesian Cerveny beams
@NALPHA@                ! Shared launch-angle count derived from fmax
-89.0  89.0 /           ! Launch angles (degrees)
0.0  101.0  5.1         ! Auto step, ZBOX (m), RBOX (km)
'MS' 2.0  1.0           ! Standard curvature, epsilon multiplier, Rloop (km)
3  5  'P'               ! Images, beam window, pressure component
